{"title":"macOS / Linux 通过国内镜像安装 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh","date":"2023-09-12T19:25:15.000Z","source":"_posts/MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh.md","raw":"---\ntitle: macOS / Linux 通过国内镜像安装 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh\ncategories: [OS]\ndate: 2023/9/12 19:25:15\n\n---\n\n## 什么是 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh\n\n**Zsh（Z Shell）** 是一款功能强大的命令行 shell，兼容 Bash，但提供了更多高级特性，如：\n- 更强大的自动补全（支持模糊匹配、菜单选择）\n- 更灵活的主题和提示符定制\n- 共享命令历史\n- 更智能的拼写纠正\n- 丰富的插件生态\n\n**Oh My Zsh** 是 Zsh 最流行的配置框架，集成了数百个插件和主题，让你开箱即用地享受 Zsh 的强大功能。\n\n## 安装 Zsh\n\n### macOS\n\nmacOS 从 Catalina (10.15) 开始已默认使用 Zsh 作为登录 shell。如果系统版本较旧或需要更新：\n\n```shell\n# 使用 Homebrew 安装最新版 Zsh\nbrew install zsh\n\n# 验证安装\nzsh --version\n```\n\n### Linux（Ubuntu/Debian）\n\n```shell\n# 更新软件包索引\nsudo apt update\n\n# 安装 zsh\nsudo apt install zsh -y\n\n# 验证安装\nzsh --version\n```\n\n### Linux（CentOS/RHEL/Fedora）\n\n```shell\n# CentOS/RHEL\nsudo yum install zsh -y\n\n# Fedora\nsudo dnf install zsh -y\n```\n\n## 设置 Zsh 为默认 Shell\n\n```shell\n# 将 zsh 设为默认 shell\nchsh -s $(which zsh)\n\n# 或手动指定路径\nchsh -s /bin/zsh\n```\n\n> **注意**：执行 `chsh` 后需要**重新登录**或重启终端才能生效。\n\n## 安装 Oh My Zsh（国内镜像加速）\n\n由于网络原因，官方安装脚本在国内可能下载缓慢或失败。以下是通过**清华 TUNA 镜像**安装的步骤：\n\n### 1. 克隆 Oh My Zsh 镜像仓库\n\n```shell\n# 从清华镜像克隆\ngit clone https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git\n\ncd ohmyzsh/tools\n```\n\n### 2. 修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\n\n编辑 `install.sh` 文件，将官方地址替换为镜像地址：\n\n```shell\nvim install.sh\n```\n\n找到以下两行（通常在文件开头附近）：\n\n```shell\nREPO=${REPO:-ohmyzsh}\nREMOTE=${REMOTE:-https://github.com/${REPO}/${REPO}.git}\n```\n\n修改为：\n\n```shell\nREPO=${REPO:-ohmyzsh}\nREMOTE=${REMOTE:-https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/${REPO}.git}\n```\n\n### 3. 执行安装脚本\n\n```shell\n# 直接运行修改后的脚本\nsh install.sh\n\n# 或使用以下方式指定 REMOTE 变量（无需修改文件）\nREMOTE=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git sh install.sh\n```\n\n安装完成后，会提示你是否要将 Zsh 设为默认 shell（如果之前没设置的话）。\n\n### 备用方案：Gitee 镜像\n\n如果 TUNA 镜像速度仍不理想，也可以使用 Gitee 镜像：\n\n```shell\nREMOTE=https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git sh -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh/raw/master/tools/install.sh)\"\n```\n\n## 配置主题\n\nOh My Zsh 默认使用 `robbyrussell` 主题。以下是安装流行的 **Powerlevel10k** 主题的步骤：\n\n### 安装 Powerlevel10k\n\n```shell\n# 从 Gitee 镜像克隆（国内更快）\ngit clone --depth=1 https://gitee.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k.git ${ZSH_CUSTOM:-$HOME/.oh-my-zsh/custom}/themes/powerlevel10k\n```\n\n### 启用主题\n\n编辑 `~/.zshrc`：\n\n```shell\nvim ~/.zshrc\n```\n\n修改主题配置：\n\n```shell\nZSH_THEME=\"powerlevel10k/powerlevel10k\"\n```\n\n保存后执行：\n\n```shell\nsource ~/.zshrc\n```\n\n首次运行 Powerlevel10k 会启动配置向导，根据提示选择喜欢的样式即可。之后可以通过以下命令重新配置：\n\n```shell\np10k configure\n```\n\n## 推荐插件\n\n编辑 `~/.zshrc`，找到 `plugins=(git)` 这一行，添加需要的插件：\n\n```shell\nplugins=(\n    git\n    zsh-autosuggestions\n    zsh-syntax-highlighting\n    autojump\n    extract\n    history\n)\n```\n\n### 常用插件安装\n\n**zsh-autosuggestions**（命令自动建议）\n\n```shell\ngit clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-autosuggestions ${ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom}/plugins/zsh-autosuggestions\n```\n\n**zsh-syntax-highlighting**（命令语法高亮）\n\n```shell\ngit clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-syntax-highlighting.git ${ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom}/plugins/zsh-syntax-highlighting\n```\n\n**autojump**（目录快速跳转）\n\n```shell\n# macOS\nbrew install autojump\n\n# Ubuntu/Debian\nsudo apt install autojump -y\n```\n\n安装完插件后，记得执行 `source ~/.zshrc` 使配置生效。\n\n## 配置镜像源（可选）\n\n如果你后续需要更新 Oh My Zsh，可以将远程仓库地址改为镜像地址：\n\n```shell\n# 进入 Oh My Zsh 目录\ncd ~/.oh-my-zsh\n\n# 查看当前远程地址\ngit remote -v\n\n# 修改为清华镜像\ngit remote set-url origin https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git\n\n# 或修改为 Gitee 镜像\ngit remote set-url origin https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git\n```\n\n## 常用 Oh My Zsh 快捷键\n\n| 快捷键 | 功能 |\n|--------|------|\n| `Tab` | 自动补全（按两次显示所有选项） |\n| `↑` / `↓` | 搜索历史命令 |\n| `Ctrl + R` | 模糊搜索历史命令 |\n| `Ctrl + A` / `Ctrl + E` | 光标移到行首 / 行尾 |\n| `Esc + .` | 插入上一条命令的最后一个参数 |\n| `!!` | 执行上一条命令 |\n| `!$` | 上一条命令的最后一个参数 |\n\n## 常见问题\n\n### 1. 安装后终端显示异常\n\n可能是终端字体不支持 Powerline 符号。建议安装 **Nerd Fonts**（如 MesloLGS NF）：\n\n```shell\n# 使用 Homebrew 安装（macOS）\nbrew tap homebrew/cask-fonts\nbrew install --cask font-meslo-lg-nerd-font\n\n# 然后在终端设置中将字体改为 MesloLGS NF\n```\n\n### 2. Oh My Zsh 启动变慢\n\n可以通过以下命令诊断启动耗时：\n\n```shell\n# 查看各插件加载时间\nfor plugin ($plugins); do; timer=$(($(date +%s%N)/1000000)); autoload -U +X bashcompinit && bashcompinit; source $ZSH_CUSTOM/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh 2>/dev/null || source $ZSH/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh; echo \"$plugin: $(($(($(date +%s%N)/1000000))-$timer))ms\"; done\n```\n\n### 3. 恢复默认 Bash\n\n如果不喜欢 Zsh，可以恢复默认 Shell：\n\n```shell\nchsh -s /bin/bash\n```\n\n然后卸载 Oh My Zsh：\n\n```shell\nuninstall_oh_my_zsh\n```\n\n\n\n\n","slug":"MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-25T06:02:39.638Z","_id":"cuid2TdfDzyZpp0Unl_sfwqEf","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"什么是-Zsh-和-Oh-My-Zsh\"><a href=\"#什么是-Zsh-和-Oh-My-Zsh\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"什么是 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh\"></a>什么是 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh</h2><p><strong>Zsh（Z Shell）</strong> 是一款功能强大的命令行 shell，兼容 Bash，但提供了更多高级特性，如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更强大的自动补全（支持模糊匹配、菜单选择）</li>\n<li>更灵活的主题和提示符定制</li>\n<li>共享命令历史</li>\n<li>更智能的拼写纠正</li>\n<li>丰富的插件生态</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Oh My Zsh</strong> 是 Zsh 最流行的配置框架，集成了数百个插件和主题，让你开箱即用地享受 Zsh 的强大功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装-Zsh\"><a href=\"#安装-Zsh\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Zsh\"></a>安装 Zsh</h2><h3 id=\"macOS\"><a href=\"#macOS\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"macOS\"></a>macOS</h3><p>macOS 从 Catalina (10.15) 开始已默认使用 Zsh 作为登录 shell。如果系统版本较旧或需要更新：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">使用 Homebrew 安装最新版 Zsh</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install zsh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">验证安装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">zsh --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Linux（Ubuntu-Debian）\"><a href=\"#Linux（Ubuntu-Debian）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Linux（Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian）\"></a>Linux（Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian）</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">更新软件包索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt update</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">安装 zsh</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt install zsh -y</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">验证安装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">zsh --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Linux（CentOS-RHEL-Fedora）\"><a href=\"#Linux（CentOS-RHEL-Fedora）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Linux（CentOS&#x2F;RHEL&#x2F;Fedora）\"></a>Linux（CentOS&#x2F;RHEL&#x2F;Fedora）</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">CentOS/RHEL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo yum install zsh -y</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">Fedora</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo dnf install zsh -y</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"设置-Zsh-为默认-Shell\"><a href=\"#设置-Zsh-为默认-Shell\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置 Zsh 为默认 Shell\"></a>设置 Zsh 为默认 Shell</h2><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">将 zsh 设为默认 shell</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">chsh -s $(which zsh)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或手动指定路径</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">chsh -s /bin/zsh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：执行 <code>chsh</code> 后需要<strong>重新登录</strong>或重启终端才能生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"安装-Oh-My-Zsh（国内镜像加速）\"><a href=\"#安装-Oh-My-Zsh（国内镜像加速）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Oh My Zsh（国内镜像加速）\"></a>安装 Oh My Zsh（国内镜像加速）</h2><p>由于网络原因，官方安装脚本在国内可能下载缓慢或失败。以下是通过<strong>清华 TUNA 镜像</strong>安装的步骤：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-克隆-Oh-My-Zsh-镜像仓库\"><a href=\"#1-克隆-Oh-My-Zsh-镜像仓库\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 克隆 Oh My Zsh 镜像仓库\"></a>1. 克隆 Oh My Zsh 镜像仓库</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">从清华镜像克隆</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git clone https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">cd ohmyzsh/tools</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"2-修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\"><a href=\"#2-修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\"></a>2. 修改安装脚本中的仓库地址</h3><p>编辑 <code>install.sh</code> 文件，将官方地址替换为镜像地址：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vim install.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>找到以下两行（通常在文件开头附近）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REPO=$&#123;REPO:-ohmyzsh&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=$&#123;REMOTE:-https://github.com/$&#123;REPO&#125;/$&#123;REPO&#125;.git&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改为：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REPO=$&#123;REPO:-ohmyzsh&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=$&#123;REMOTE:-https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/$&#123;REPO&#125;.git&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-执行安装脚本\"><a href=\"#3-执行安装脚本\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 执行安装脚本\"></a>3. 执行安装脚本</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">直接运行修改后的脚本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sh install.sh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或使用以下方式指定 REMOTE 变量（无需修改文件）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git sh install.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>安装完成后，会提示你是否要将 Zsh 设为默认 shell（如果之前没设置的话）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"备用方案：Gitee-镜像\"><a href=\"#备用方案：Gitee-镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"备用方案：Gitee 镜像\"></a>备用方案：Gitee 镜像</h3><p>如果 TUNA 镜像速度仍不理想，也可以使用 Gitee 镜像：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git sh -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh/raw/master/tools/install.sh)&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"配置主题\"><a href=\"#配置主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置主题\"></a>配置主题</h2><p>Oh My Zsh 默认使用 <code>robbyrussell</code> 主题。以下是安装流行的 <strong>Powerlevel10k</strong> 主题的步骤：</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装-Powerlevel10k\"><a href=\"#安装-Powerlevel10k\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Powerlevel10k\"></a>安装 Powerlevel10k</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">从 Gitee 镜像克隆（国内更快）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git clone --depth=1 https://gitee.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k.git $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-$HOME/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/themes/powerlevel10k</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"启用主题\"><a href=\"#启用主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启用主题\"></a>启用主题</h3><p>编辑 <code>~/.zshrc</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vim ~/.zshrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改主题配置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ZSH_THEME=&quot;powerlevel10k/powerlevel10k&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>保存后执行：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">source ~/.zshrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>首次运行 Powerlevel10k 会启动配置向导，根据提示选择喜欢的样式即可。之后可以通过以下命令重新配置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">p10k configure</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"推荐插件\"><a href=\"#推荐插件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推荐插件\"></a>推荐插件</h2><p>编辑 <code>~/.zshrc</code>，找到 <code>plugins=(git)</code> 这一行，添加需要的插件：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">plugins=(</span><br><span class=\"line\">    git</span><br><span class=\"line\">    zsh-autosuggestions</span><br><span class=\"line\">    zsh-syntax-highlighting</span><br><span class=\"line\">    autojump</span><br><span class=\"line\">    extract</span><br><span class=\"line\">    history</span><br><span class=\"line\">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"常用插件安装\"><a href=\"#常用插件安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用插件安装\"></a>常用插件安装</h3><p><strong>zsh-autosuggestions</strong>（命令自动建议）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-autosuggestions $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/plugins/zsh-autosuggestions</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>zsh-syntax-highlighting</strong>（命令语法高亮）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-syntax-highlighting.git $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/plugins/zsh-syntax-highlighting</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>autojump</strong>（目录快速跳转）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">macOS</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install autojump</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">Ubuntu/Debian</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt install autojump -y</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>安装完插件后，记得执行 <code>source ~/.zshrc</code> 使配置生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置镜像源（可选）\"><a href=\"#配置镜像源（可选）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置镜像源（可选）\"></a>配置镜像源（可选）</h2><p>如果你后续需要更新 Oh My Zsh，可以将远程仓库地址改为镜像地址：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">进入 Oh My Zsh 目录</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">cd ~/.oh-my-zsh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">查看当前远程地址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote -v</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">修改为清华镜像</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote set-url origin https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或修改为 Gitee 镜像</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote set-url origin https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"常用-Oh-My-Zsh-快捷键\"><a href=\"#常用-Oh-My-Zsh-快捷键\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用 Oh My Zsh 快捷键\"></a>常用 Oh My Zsh 快捷键</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Tab</code></td>\n<td>自动补全（按两次显示所有选项）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>↑</code> &#x2F; <code>↓</code></td>\n<td>搜索历史命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ctrl + R</code></td>\n<td>模糊搜索历史命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ctrl + A</code> &#x2F; <code>Ctrl + E</code></td>\n<td>光标移到行首 &#x2F; 行尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Esc + .</code></td>\n<td>插入上一条命令的最后一个参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!!</code></td>\n<td>执行上一条命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!$</code></td>\n<td>上一条命令的最后一个参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\"><a href=\"#常见问题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见问题\"></a>常见问题</h2><h3 id=\"1-安装后终端显示异常\"><a href=\"#1-安装后终端显示异常\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 安装后终端显示异常\"></a>1. 安装后终端显示异常</h3><p>可能是终端字体不支持 Powerline 符号。建议安装 <strong>Nerd Fonts</strong>（如 MesloLGS NF）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">使用 Homebrew 安装（macOS）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew tap homebrew/cask-fonts</span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install --cask font-meslo-lg-nerd-font</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">然后在终端设置中将字体改为 MesloLGS NF</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"2-Oh-My-Zsh-启动变慢\"><a href=\"#2-Oh-My-Zsh-启动变慢\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. Oh My Zsh 启动变慢\"></a>2. Oh My Zsh 启动变慢</h3><p>可以通过以下命令诊断启动耗时：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">查看各插件加载时间</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">for plugin ($plugins); do; timer=$(($(date +%s%N)/1000000)); autoload -U +X bashcompinit &amp;&amp; bashcompinit; source $ZSH_CUSTOM/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh 2&gt;/dev/null || source $ZSH/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh; echo &quot;$plugin: $(($(($(date +%s%N)/1000000))-$timer))ms&quot;; done</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-恢复默认-Bash\"><a href=\"#3-恢复默认-Bash\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 恢复默认 Bash\"></a>3. 恢复默认 Bash</h3><p>如果不喜欢 Zsh，可以恢复默认 Shell：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chsh -s /bin/bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>然后卸载 Oh My Zsh：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uninstall_oh_my_zsh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"什么是-Zsh-和-Oh-My-Zsh\"><a href=\"#什么是-Zsh-和-Oh-My-Zsh\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"什么是 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh\"></a>什么是 Zsh 和 Oh My Zsh</h2><p><strong>Zsh（Z Shell）</strong> 是一款功能强大的命令行 shell，兼容 Bash，但提供了更多高级特性，如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更强大的自动补全（支持模糊匹配、菜单选择）</li>\n<li>更灵活的主题和提示符定制</li>\n<li>共享命令历史</li>\n<li>更智能的拼写纠正</li>\n<li>丰富的插件生态</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Oh My Zsh</strong> 是 Zsh 最流行的配置框架，集成了数百个插件和主题，让你开箱即用地享受 Zsh 的强大功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装-Zsh\"><a href=\"#安装-Zsh\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Zsh\"></a>安装 Zsh</h2><h3 id=\"macOS\"><a href=\"#macOS\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"macOS\"></a>macOS</h3><p>macOS 从 Catalina (10.15) 开始已默认使用 Zsh 作为登录 shell。如果系统版本较旧或需要更新：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">使用 Homebrew 安装最新版 Zsh</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install zsh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">验证安装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">zsh --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Linux（Ubuntu-Debian）\"><a href=\"#Linux（Ubuntu-Debian）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Linux（Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian）\"></a>Linux（Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian）</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">更新软件包索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt update</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">安装 zsh</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt install zsh -y</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">验证安装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">zsh --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"Linux（CentOS-RHEL-Fedora）\"><a href=\"#Linux（CentOS-RHEL-Fedora）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Linux（CentOS&#x2F;RHEL&#x2F;Fedora）\"></a>Linux（CentOS&#x2F;RHEL&#x2F;Fedora）</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">CentOS/RHEL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo yum install zsh -y</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">Fedora</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo dnf install zsh -y</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"设置-Zsh-为默认-Shell\"><a href=\"#设置-Zsh-为默认-Shell\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置 Zsh 为默认 Shell\"></a>设置 Zsh 为默认 Shell</h2><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">将 zsh 设为默认 shell</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">chsh -s $(which zsh)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或手动指定路径</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">chsh -s /bin/zsh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：执行 <code>chsh</code> 后需要<strong>重新登录</strong>或重启终端才能生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"安装-Oh-My-Zsh（国内镜像加速）\"><a href=\"#安装-Oh-My-Zsh（国内镜像加速）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Oh My Zsh（国内镜像加速）\"></a>安装 Oh My Zsh（国内镜像加速）</h2><p>由于网络原因，官方安装脚本在国内可能下载缓慢或失败。以下是通过<strong>清华 TUNA 镜像</strong>安装的步骤：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-克隆-Oh-My-Zsh-镜像仓库\"><a href=\"#1-克隆-Oh-My-Zsh-镜像仓库\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 克隆 Oh My Zsh 镜像仓库\"></a>1. 克隆 Oh My Zsh 镜像仓库</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">从清华镜像克隆</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git clone https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">cd ohmyzsh/tools</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"2-修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\"><a href=\"#2-修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 修改安装脚本中的仓库地址\"></a>2. 修改安装脚本中的仓库地址</h3><p>编辑 <code>install.sh</code> 文件，将官方地址替换为镜像地址：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vim install.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>找到以下两行（通常在文件开头附近）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REPO=$&#123;REPO:-ohmyzsh&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=$&#123;REMOTE:-https://github.com/$&#123;REPO&#125;/$&#123;REPO&#125;.git&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改为：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REPO=$&#123;REPO:-ohmyzsh&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=$&#123;REMOTE:-https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/$&#123;REPO&#125;.git&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-执行安装脚本\"><a href=\"#3-执行安装脚本\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 执行安装脚本\"></a>3. 执行安装脚本</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">直接运行修改后的脚本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sh install.sh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或使用以下方式指定 REMOTE 变量（无需修改文件）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git sh install.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>安装完成后，会提示你是否要将 Zsh 设为默认 shell（如果之前没设置的话）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"备用方案：Gitee-镜像\"><a href=\"#备用方案：Gitee-镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"备用方案：Gitee 镜像\"></a>备用方案：Gitee 镜像</h3><p>如果 TUNA 镜像速度仍不理想，也可以使用 Gitee 镜像：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">REMOTE=https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git sh -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh/raw/master/tools/install.sh)&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"配置主题\"><a href=\"#配置主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置主题\"></a>配置主题</h2><p>Oh My Zsh 默认使用 <code>robbyrussell</code> 主题。以下是安装流行的 <strong>Powerlevel10k</strong> 主题的步骤：</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装-Powerlevel10k\"><a href=\"#安装-Powerlevel10k\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装 Powerlevel10k\"></a>安装 Powerlevel10k</h3><figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">从 Gitee 镜像克隆（国内更快）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git clone --depth=1 https://gitee.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k.git $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-$HOME/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/themes/powerlevel10k</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"启用主题\"><a href=\"#启用主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启用主题\"></a>启用主题</h3><p>编辑 <code>~/.zshrc</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vim ~/.zshrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改主题配置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ZSH_THEME=&quot;powerlevel10k/powerlevel10k&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>保存后执行：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">source ~/.zshrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>首次运行 Powerlevel10k 会启动配置向导，根据提示选择喜欢的样式即可。之后可以通过以下命令重新配置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">p10k configure</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"推荐插件\"><a href=\"#推荐插件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推荐插件\"></a>推荐插件</h2><p>编辑 <code>~/.zshrc</code>，找到 <code>plugins=(git)</code> 这一行，添加需要的插件：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">plugins=(</span><br><span class=\"line\">    git</span><br><span class=\"line\">    zsh-autosuggestions</span><br><span class=\"line\">    zsh-syntax-highlighting</span><br><span class=\"line\">    autojump</span><br><span class=\"line\">    extract</span><br><span class=\"line\">    history</span><br><span class=\"line\">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"常用插件安装\"><a href=\"#常用插件安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用插件安装\"></a>常用插件安装</h3><p><strong>zsh-autosuggestions</strong>（命令自动建议）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-autosuggestions $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/plugins/zsh-autosuggestions</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>zsh-syntax-highlighting</strong>（命令语法高亮）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git clone https://gitee.com/mirrors/zsh-syntax-highlighting.git $&#123;ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom&#125;/plugins/zsh-syntax-highlighting</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>autojump</strong>（目录快速跳转）</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">macOS</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install autojump</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">Ubuntu/Debian</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sudo apt install autojump -y</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>安装完插件后，记得执行 <code>source ~/.zshrc</code> 使配置生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置镜像源（可选）\"><a href=\"#配置镜像源（可选）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置镜像源（可选）\"></a>配置镜像源（可选）</h2><p>如果你后续需要更新 Oh My Zsh，可以将远程仓库地址改为镜像地址：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">进入 Oh My Zsh 目录</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">cd ~/.oh-my-zsh</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">查看当前远程地址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote -v</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">修改为清华镜像</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote set-url origin https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">或修改为 Gitee 镜像</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">git remote set-url origin https://gitee.com/mirrors/oh-my-zsh.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"常用-Oh-My-Zsh-快捷键\"><a href=\"#常用-Oh-My-Zsh-快捷键\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用 Oh My Zsh 快捷键\"></a>常用 Oh My Zsh 快捷键</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>快捷键</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Tab</code></td>\n<td>自动补全（按两次显示所有选项）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>↑</code> &#x2F; <code>↓</code></td>\n<td>搜索历史命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ctrl + R</code></td>\n<td>模糊搜索历史命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ctrl + A</code> &#x2F; <code>Ctrl + E</code></td>\n<td>光标移到行首 &#x2F; 行尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Esc + .</code></td>\n<td>插入上一条命令的最后一个参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!!</code></td>\n<td>执行上一条命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!$</code></td>\n<td>上一条命令的最后一个参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\"><a href=\"#常见问题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见问题\"></a>常见问题</h2><h3 id=\"1-安装后终端显示异常\"><a href=\"#1-安装后终端显示异常\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 安装后终端显示异常\"></a>1. 安装后终端显示异常</h3><p>可能是终端字体不支持 Powerline 符号。建议安装 <strong>Nerd Fonts</strong>（如 MesloLGS NF）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">使用 Homebrew 安装（macOS）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">brew tap homebrew/cask-fonts</span><br><span class=\"line\">brew install --cask font-meslo-lg-nerd-font</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">然后在终端设置中将字体改为 MesloLGS NF</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"2-Oh-My-Zsh-启动变慢\"><a href=\"#2-Oh-My-Zsh-启动变慢\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. Oh My Zsh 启动变慢\"></a>2. Oh My Zsh 启动变慢</h3><p>可以通过以下命令诊断启动耗时：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">查看各插件加载时间</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">for plugin ($plugins); do; timer=$(($(date +%s%N)/1000000)); autoload -U +X bashcompinit &amp;&amp; bashcompinit; source $ZSH_CUSTOM/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh 2&gt;/dev/null || source $ZSH/plugins/$plugin/$plugin.plugin.zsh; echo &quot;$plugin: $(($(($(date +%s%N)/1000000))-$timer))ms&quot;; done</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-恢复默认-Bash\"><a href=\"#3-恢复默认-Bash\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 恢复默认 Bash\"></a>3. 恢复默认 Bash</h3><p>如果不喜欢 Zsh，可以恢复默认 Shell：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chsh -s /bin/bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>然后卸载 Oh My Zsh：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uninstall_oh_my_zsh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n\n\n\n","path":"2023/09/12/MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh/","permalink":"https://fengwei7.github.io/2023/09/12/MacOS%E3%80%81Linux%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85zsh%E5%92%8Coh%20my%20zsh/","tags":[],"categories":[{"name":"OS","_id":"cuids5VGOtL3T_AUoDl8Iowar","slug":"OS","path":"categories/OS/","permalink":"https://fengwei7.github.io/categories/OS/","length":4}],"prev":{"title":"Java Stream 流详解","date":"2023-11-05T16:45:33.000Z","slug":"Java-Stream流","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-25T06:02:39.638Z","_id":"cuidgOU-fmTV3OJFrQXntY9u2","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2023/11/05/Java-Stream流/","permalink":"https://fengwei7.github.io/2023/11/05/Java-Stream%E6%B5%81/","__post":true},"next":{"title":"设计模式","date":"2022-08-22T09:15:10.000Z","slug":"设计模式","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-25T06:02:39.638Z","_id":"cuidX-_qXeTubN4opQugBoVHh","layout":"post","photos":[],"excerpt":"","path":"2022/08/22/设计模式/","permalink":"https://fengwei7.github.io/2022/08/22/%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/","__post":true},"__post":true}